                   QUERY PLAN                   
------------------------------------------------
 Aggregate
   ->  Gather Motion 1:1  (slice1; segments: 1)
         ->  Custom Scan (VectorRegion)
               ->  Seq Scan on cov_aoco
                     Filter: (a = 3)
(6 rows)

